// Package orgclient is a thin wrapper over the org-svc gRPC clients used by
// workspace BFFs: FeatureFlagServiceClient (every BFF), TenantServiceClient
// (VerifyMembership and/or ListMembershipsByTenant, used by some BFFs), and
// ShareCodeServiceClient (RedeemCode, range-bff only).
//
// This package unifies what used to be 13 near-identical
// services/*-bff/internal/orgclient copies (T20, epic #2431). The dial /
// Close / ListFeatureFlags core was byte-identical across all of them; the
// only divergence was which additional sub-client methods a given BFF
// needed. shell-bff and admin-bff keep their own, much larger, orgclient
// packages (11 and 30 methods respectively) — out of scope here.
//
// Every method here forwards the CALLER's user bearer token via the inbound
// ctx (never service-account credentials) — see the VerifyMembership and
// RedeemCode doc comments for the azp-allowlist subtlety this depends on.
//
// Transport credentials follow the shared mtls package: mTLS when the
// MTLS_*_FILE env vars are set, insecure otherwise (NewClient fails closed on
// a partial mTLS config rather than silently falling back to insecure).
package orgclient


